  "prompt": "A flat, top-down view of a large sand art illustration, approximately 20 meters in length, created on the ground of a public park. The artwork is entirely two-dimensional, composed of fine, multicolored sand grains arranged into a vibrant, intricate image of a Japanese-style dragon. The dragon features flowing lines, ornate scales, and traditional brushstroke-inspired design elements, reminiscent of classic Japanese painting. The sand lies flush with the ground --no elevation or sculptural depth. The park surface is slightly uneven with patches of grass or dirt visible at the edges. Near the artwork stands the artist, a human figure providing scale, appearing small next to the massive dragon design. The lighting is natural and soft, highlighting the vivid colors without creating dramatic shadows. The overall composition feels delicate, skillful, and ephemeral, emphasizing the impermanence of sand art. --ar 3:4 --raw --v 7",
